cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JAC in published work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "JenaAtomicCalculator (JAC)"
abstract: >
  JAC is an open-source Julia package for atomic structure and collision computations.
  It provides a relativistic electronic-structure code for interaction amplitudes,
  atomic properties, excitation/decay processes, cascade simulations, and symbolic
  Racah-algebra manipulations.
authors:
